{"id": "7ed22c23-357e-44f4-be29-59400f791e7f", "slug": "ares-pioneering-the-crimson-frontier-1", "title": "Ares | Pioneering the Crimson Frontier", "description": "Ares Pioneering Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Ares | Pioneering the Crimson Frontier\"\ndescription: \"Ares Pioneering Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EA580C\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#992B0A\"\n  background: \"#050201\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Ares | Pioneering the Crimson Frontier\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 296; favorites: 10; remixes: 19.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, bento, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nAres Pioneering Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAres Settlements Topography Rovers Crew Initialize Sequence Project Genesis Active Pioneering the Crimson Frontier Establish advanced biospheres, extract subterranean resources, and build the foundation for humanity's f…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Pioneering the Crimson Frontier; Sector Prime; Off-World Infrastructure; Aquatic Extractors; Habitation Modules; Ares Gateway.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EA580C, secondary #000000, accent #992B0A, background #050201, surface #191C21, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased selection:bg-orange-500/30 selection:text-white\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Ares | Pioneering the Crimson Frontier</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050201] text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col relative\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Mars Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Subtle Diagonal Background Texture -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.02]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 40px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Radial Gradient Overlay to enhance Martian atmosphere -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 50%, rgba(153, 43, 10, 0.35) 0%, rgba(5, 2, 1, 0.95) 80%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 border-x border-white/[0.03]\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 border-b border-orange-900/30\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-broken\" style=\"color: #ea580c;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                Ares\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-white/50\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Settlements</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Topography</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Rovers</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Crew</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- CTA Button -->\n            <button class=\"relative px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-normal text-white bg-transparent hover:bg-orange-500/10 transition-colors group\">\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-l border-orange-500/40 group-hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-r border-orange-500/40 group-hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-l border-orange-500/40 group-hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-r border-orange-500/40 group-hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors\"></span>\n                Initialize Sequence\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-stretch justify-between w-full py-20 lg:py-32 gap-12\">\n\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-8 rounded-full border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-500/5 text-xs text-orange-400 font-normal tracking-wide shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] w-max\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                    Project Genesis Active\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"scroll-reveal text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05] mb-8 text-white/95 font-extralight tracking-tight\">\n                    Pioneering the Crimson Frontier\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-white/50 max-w-lg mb-12 font-extralight leading-relaxed\">\n                    Establish advanced biospheres, extract subterranean resources, and build the foundation for humanity's first lasting settlement on Mars.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start sm:items-center\">\n                    <button class=\"px-7 py-3.5 bg-orange-600 text-white text-sm font-normal hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                        Enlist Now\n                    </button>\n\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm text-white/80 hover:text-white bg-transparent hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-broken\" class=\"text-orange-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Explore Topography\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Premium Hero Card -->\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:w-5/12 reveal-fade flex\">\n                <div class=\"relative flex flex-col justify-between w-full min-h-[320px] lg:min-h-[400px] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.15), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(#0a0504, #0a0504) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.5), rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-500 shadow-inner\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-broken\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white/90\">Sector Prime</h3>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-500 font-mono tracking-wide\">SEC-00</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 mb-1\">Atmosphere</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-white/80 font-extralight tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500\"></span> Optimal\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col pl-4 border-l border-white/10\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 mb-1\">Capacity Limit</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-white/80 font-extralight tracking-tight\">1,250 Units</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Extraterrestrial Architecture Section -->\n        <section class=\"w-full py-24 border-t border-orange-900/20\">\n            <h2 class=\"scroll-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-12 text-white/90 font-extralight tracking-tight text-center\">\n                Off-World Infrastructure\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch\">\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"reveal-fade flex flex-col rounded-xl p-8 min-h-[280px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(#0a0504, #0a0504) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/60 mb-6\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-broken\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col flex-grow\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white/90 mb-3\">Aquatic Extractors</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-white/40 font-extralight mb-8 flex-grow\">Sub-surface water mining operations utilizing radiation-resistant synthetic shielding.</p>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/80\">Dr. K. Vance</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-extralight\">Chief Engineer</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-500\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-broken\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"reveal-fade flex flex-col rounded-xl p-8 min-h-[280px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(#0a0504, #0a0504) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/60 mb-6\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-angle-broken\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col flex-grow\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white/90 mb-3\">Habitation Modules</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-white/40 font-extralight mb-8 flex-grow\">Quick-deploy living quarters adapted for the extreme conditions of the Martian equator.</p>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/80\">Cmdr. E. Lin</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-extralight\">Recon Leader</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-500\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-broken\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"reveal-fade flex flex-col rounded-xl p-8 min-h-[280px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(#0a0504, #0a0504) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/60 mb-6\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:double-alt-arrow-up-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col flex-grow\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white/90 mb-3\">Ares Gateway</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-white/40 font-extralight mb-8 flex-grow\">Orbital logistics nexus coordinating all transit between the planetary surface and Earth.</p>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/80\">System Auth</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-extralight\">AI Overseer</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-white/60\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-broken\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Info Section -->\n        <footer class=\"w-full py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-end justify-between gap-12 mt-auto border-t border-white/[0.03]\">\n\n            <!-- Partners -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 w-full lg:w-auto\">\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-white/40 font-extralight\">Supported by interplanetary coalitions</p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 opacity-40 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 text-white\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight\">Olympo</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-broken\" class=\"text-orange-500\"></iconify-icon> Aegis</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight lowercase\">strata.</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight italic\">Helios</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Stats Box -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-auto min-w-[320px] md:min-w-[500px] p-8 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.01)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight\">1.5k</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed font-extralight\">Active specialists</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight\">22</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed font-extralight\">Active bases</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight\">96%</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed font-extralight\">Self-sufficiency rate</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Animation ---\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.scroll-reveal');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word) => {\n                    const wordContainer = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordContainer.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wordContainer.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wordContainer.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                    wordContainer.style.marginRight = '0.25rem';\n                    wordContainer.style.paddingBottom = '0.1rem';\n\n                    const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerSpan.innerText = word;\n\n                    wordContainer.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                    el.appendChild(wordContainer);\n                });\n\n                gsap.fromTo(el.querySelectorAll('span > span'),\n                    { y: '120%', rotation: 4, transformOrigin: \"0% 100%\" },\n                    {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        rotation: 0,\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        stagger: 0.03,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: \"top 90%\",\n                            toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // Fade in standard elements\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.reveal-fade').forEach(element => {\n                gsap.fromTo(element,\n                    { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                    {\n                        y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: element,\n                            start: \"top 85%\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            gsap.from(\"p, button, footer > div\", {\n                y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power2.out\", delay: 0.8\n            });\n            gsap.from(\"header\", {\n                y: -20, opacity: 0, duration: 1, ease: \"power2.out\"\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js Mars Globe Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        // Setup Camera\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.z = 28;\n        camera.position.y = 0;\n        camera.position.x = 8;\n\n        // Setup Renderer\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Texture Loader\n        const textureLoader = new THREE.TextureLoader();\n        textureLoader.setCrossOrigin('anonymous');\n\n        // Using Earth topology map as a bump to simulate Martian craters/ridges\n        const bumpMap = textureLoader.load('https://unpkg.com/three-globe/example/img/earth-topology.png');\n\n        // Create Massive Mars Sphere (Significantly increased radius)\n        const geometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(72, 64, 64);\n        const material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n            color: 0xc24117,\n            bumpMap: bumpMap,\n            bumpScale: 1.2,\n            roughness: 0.85,\n            metalness: 0.1\n        });\n\n        const mars = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        // Pushed back on the z-axis and offset to accommodate the massive new size\n        mars.position.set(35, -15, -60);\n        scene.add(mars);\n\n        // Thin Martian Atmosphere Glow (Scaled to match)\n        const atmosphereGeometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(73.5, 64, 64);\n        const atmosphereMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0xff4400,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.08,\n            side: THREE.BackSide,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n        const atmosphere = new THREE.Mesh(atmosphereGeometry, atmosphereMaterial);\n        mars.add(atmosphere);\n\n        // Lighting\n        const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.05);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n        const directionalLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfff0dd, 1.5);\n        directionalLight.position.set(-10, 5, 8);\n        scene.add(directionalLight);\n\n        // Starfield\n        const starsGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const starsMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            color: 0xffddcc,\n            size: 0.04,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.6,\n            sizeAttenuation: true\n        });\n\n        const starsVertices = [];\n        for (let i = 0; i < 2000; i++) {\n            const x = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(300);\n            const y = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(300);\n            const z = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(150) - 100;\n            starsVertices.push(x, y, z);\n        }\n\n        starsGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(starsVertices, 3));\n        const starField = new THREE.Points(starsGeometry, starsMaterial);\n        scene.add(starField);\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const animate = function () {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Subtle rotation\n            mars.rotation.y += 0.0003;\n            starField.rotation.y -= 0.0001;\n\n            // Parallax effect on mouse move\n            camera.position.x += (mouseX * 2 - camera.position.x) * 0.02 + 8;\n            camera.position.y += (-mouseY * 2 - camera.position.y) * 0.02;\n            camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        };\n\n        // Mouse interaction\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n            mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 - 1;\n        });\n\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        }, false);\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "ares-pioneering-the-crimson-frontier-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/ares-pioneering-the-crimson-frontier-1.jpg", "source_name": "ares-pioneering-the-crimson-frontier-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 643, "forks": 32, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:29:04.58917+00:00"}